# Response headers for everything served from Workers Static Assets (the SPA
# shell, JS, CSS, fonts, images). API responses get their own headers from
# src/worker/index.ts. Keep the two in sync when adding origins.
#
# style-src allows inline styles because UI primitives position popovers with
# style attributes. challenges.cloudflare.com serves the Turnstile widget
# (script and frame) when bot protection is enabled.
# Third-party analytics is not loaded on account, invitation, or content routes.
#
# Cloud storage connections use same-origin server OAuth callbacks and encrypted
# account-owned refresh credentials. Google Picker loads apis.google.com and
# renders in docs.google.com to grant access to user-selected Drive files/folders.
# Browser file bytes go directly to the configured provider's media endpoints;
# OneDrive download/upload hosts differ between personal and work accounts.
# PDF.js and every font/decoder asset are self-hosted. wasm-unsafe-eval allows
# its sandboxed image/color decoders; general JavaScript eval remains forbidden.
# Every other script stays self-hosted. Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy is relaxed to
# same-origin-allow-popups because all three pickers hand their result back
# through a popup's window.opener, which a bare same-origin policy severs.
# Tracked in PLAN.md §9.
#
# No upgrade-insecure-requests: production is HTTPS-only behind HSTS, every
# source list here is 'self' or an explicit https origin, and an https page
# cannot load http subresources under this policy anyway. WebKit (Safari) also
# applies the directive to plain-http localhost, which Chromium exempts, so the
# directive made the local preview unrenderable in the iPhone test projects.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://apis.google.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' blob: data:; media-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://www.googleapis.com https://*.dropboxusercontent.com https://api.dropboxapi.com https://content.dropboxapi.com https://graph.microsoft.com https://*.files.1drv.com https://*.up.1drv.com https://my.microsoftpersonalcontent.com https://*.sharepoint.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://docs.google.com https://accounts.google.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
